<title>USA: Eastern Environmental plans shr offering.</title>
<headline>Eastern Environmental plans shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT LAUREL, N.J. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Environmental Services Inc Thursday said it intends to file with the Securities and Exchange Commission on or about May 15 for the issuance of 4.5 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the offering will be made by means of a prospectus.</p>
<p>Eastern Environmental is a non-hazardous solid waste management company.</p>
